Description: Unisoc per-call SIM slots and shared ModemManager call tracking
 Add an optional sim-slot call creation property and a read-only Call.SimSlot.
 Keep native call objects and state handling; select the call's radio within
 every AT control command, independently of primary/data SIM selection.
Author: e5-linux
Forwarded: no

